				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>From <a class="yt-uix-sessionlink g-hovercard      spf-link " href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_SzXeIdnTyNIc7gXHXs_iw" data-ytid="UC_SzXeIdnTyNIc7gXHXs_iw" data-sessionlink="itct=CCQQ4TkiEwjDnKfK9oTHAhWmUsIKHa66DuMo-B0">Great Documentaries</a>:</p>
<p><em>Madonna is an American pop icon and a revolutionary who remains one of the most influential figures in American music and culture today. Madonna is the material girl who made it through the wilderness of anonymity to become one of the most enduring pop icons and entertainers of all time. Madonna’s fame has endured for decades and she refuses to let go of her stranglehold of ‘cool’. <strong>Throughout her life she has pushed the envelope</strong>. Unequivocally, she has stood the test of time fully supported by her huge global fan base. One of Madonna’s greatest achievements is how she has manipulated the media and the public with her music, her videos, her publicity, and her sexuality. Arguably, <strong>Madonna was the first female pop star to have complete control of her music and image</strong>. Crystallize sets its focus on examining what drives this inspirational mother, astute business- women and talented performer, whom over decades in the spotlight, continues to transform and transfix audiences across the globe.</em></p>
